403 egress denied
destination: %H:%p
control:     method (only CONNECT is accepted on this proxy)
policy:      @POLICY_PATH@  (profile "@PROFILE@")
remediation: none -- the mediator tunnels TLS and never handles a plaintext HTTP request, because
             holding one would be the content-inspection capability this architecture does not have
record:      the mediator's audit line for this attempt is the authoritative denial record
